AudioTrack.description:
One audio stream of a media file, as the probe reported it. A screen
recording keeps the desktop's sound and the microphone as two of these;
a clip names the one it plays by `index`.

oneOf.description:
Replaces selected video clips with their host-rendered media, as one
undoable edit. Keeps the earliest clip's id, track and timeline span;
resets baked properties. The host must render only these clips first.
